{"id": "1550995162719850616", "channel_id": "1550995162719850616", "author_id": "955568930389385297", "author_name": "tmym.mo", "content": "This has been an issue since I started playing about 2 months ago. The GUI that's supposed to let you select your account keeps flickering in and out. I try to press the login button, then another window pops up and its just the close button. The recording doesn't show my mouse movements, but the size of the window is just the button size, a square. Somehow managed to get through it before but not this time.\n\nSTEAMOS/STEAMDECK/STEAM MACHINE", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T22:21:02.889000+00:00", "thread_id": "1550995162719850616", "attachments": [{"id": "1550995164795768882", "filename": "clip_1789855657449.mp4", "content_type": "video/mp4", "size": 45614443, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1550995162719850616/1550995164795768882/clip_1789855657449.mp4?ex=6ab05c4f&is=6aaf0acf&hm=381ccf9a9af6410d098d891928037157d3c3b0a0e2ecdd23b2c282ddbbfbe324&"}], "thread_title": "[BUG] Steam login not functioning", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1542484376573583380", "1542484945447026708", "1542479601241030726"], "is_thread_starter": true}
{"id": "1551074016905662505", "channel_id": "1550995162719850616", "author_id": "1495990315960762388", "author_name": "morimensstaff86", "content": "Dear Player,\n\nThe Steam Deck currently does not support the display and signing of the latest user agreement protocol.\n\nTo resolve this, we recommend using a mobile device that matches the same release region as your Steam Deck. Please log in to the game on that mobile device, complete the agreement signing process, and then return to your Steam Deck to continue playing.", "timestamp": "2026-09-20T03:34:23.192000+00:00", "thread_id": "1550995162719850616", "thread_title": "[BUG] Steam login not functioning", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1542484376573583380", "1542484945447026708", "1542479601241030726"]}
{"id": "1551026594959589399", "channel_id": "1543844957859745862", "author_id": "310254141639491590", "author_name": "alexisvaunt", "content": "Fair. I just worry there's no possibility of sufficient scaling to contribute at all into end-game using %base damage without having the scaling be a huge multiplier. With a relatively small % current damage multiplier, it can do relatively little at low levels and without building the team around it, but be a strong scaler for late-game if you build for it specifically. I have no idea what the numbers would have to be for that, but it could probably be narrowed down to something good without *too* much play-testing. At the very least, it should be much easier to balance than %HP in the current meta, where HP on enemies can go up by an order of magnitude with no warning lol.", "timestamp": "2026-09-20T00:25:56.919000+00:00", "type": 19, "thread_id": "1543844957859745862", "mentions": ["693905974750216212"], "reply_to": "1550974095015809205", "thread_title": "Do not Forget: Jenkins", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1542484945447026708", "1542484013652910141"]}
